  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The Hagraven shoots out her feathers.
  - The Hagraven launches her feathers in an arc, descending them upon {mc} and Sayori.
  - The Hagraven, demonstrating some of her druidic magic, flings sharp leaves at
    the pair.
  - The Hagraven attempts a more concentrated burst of leaves, requiring the use
    of a shield to defend against them.
  - The Hagraven flings out her feathers toward the flanks.
  - The Hagraven grows terrible flowers from the ground, which fire out their petals
    in a painful manner.
  - The flowers just keep coming, with a root tangling around {mc}'s leg. He is forced
    to defend with his shield-!
