  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The Hagraven shoots out her feathers. Again.
  - The Hagraven grows flowers from the ground. Again.
  - The Hagraven flings sharp leaves. Again.
  - The Hagraven flings out feathers toward the flanks. Again.
  - The Hagraven launchers her feathers in an arc from above. Again.
  - The Hagraven attempts to root {mc} while growing flowers. Again. (Friggin' botanists...)
  - The Hagraven attempts another concentrated burst of leaves.
  maxHealth: 130
